      "name": "Descriptive state sentences",
      "explain": "Describe how someone/something is with 很 + adjective (\"very...\"), or 觉得 + adjective for an emotional state (\"[I] feel...\"). Adjectives can be chained with 也 (\"...and also...\") to build a fuller description.",
